# .tm-allowlist — verbatim exemptions per Registry of Marks §1.2 (identifiers) and §4 (identifier rule).
# One regex per line, matched against the whole line. Comments start with #.
# Every entry states WHY the occurrence is an identifier, not prose.
# §1.2 — shell commands that were run, preserved exactly
python ingest_conversations\.py query "What is A Mirror of My Becoming\?"
# §1.2 — quoted change-record (a quoted question inside a "What: Changed" entry)
Changed "How did IBM use watsonx\.\.\." to "How does A Mirror of My Becoming
# §1.2 — literal folder names (paths on disk, preserved exactly)
trae A Mirror of My Becoming
